%% title: Stablecoin withdrawals — pre-deduction and result-driven rollback
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant GW as Blockchain gateway
    box rgb(219,234,254) ★ = built by me
    participant S as api-blockchain-supporter ★
    end
    participant P as Policy (sentinel)
    participant AC as api-account
    participant BC as Blockchain
    participant K as Transaction result topics
    U->>GW: Withdrawal (USDT · NXPC)
    GW->>S: Ask whether the withdrawal is allowed
    S->>P: Check exemptions · country limits
    S->>AC: Check account state
    S->>S: Daily limit check + pre-deduct ★
    alt over limit · restricted
        S-->>GW: Reject
    else allowed
        S-->>GW: Allow
        GW->>BC: Forward transaction
        BC-->>K: Success / failure / dropped
        K->>S: Receive result (switched to result topics ★)
        S->>S: Clean up competing requests with the same nonce (3+ case ★)
        alt failure · dropped
            S->>S: Roll back pre-deduction
        end
    end
    note over GW,AC: Pre-deduction is final — only reversed on failure
